@startuml 11-sequence-transaction-service
title transaction-service - Diagrama de secuencia

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Cliente / servicio\n(Postman, account-service o credit-service)" as User
participant "MovementController\n(adaptador WebFlux)" as Controller
participant "MovementApplicationService\n(casos de uso, RxJava 3)" as Service
participant "MovementRepositoryPort + adaptador MongoDB\n(puerto RxJava; conversión Reactor en el adaptador)" as Repo
database "MongoDB\nmovement_db" as DB
participant "CorrelationIdWebFilter\n(WebFilter, prioridad máxima)" as Correlation

note over Controller, Repo
  WebFlux conserva Mono/Flux en el límite HTTP.
  El controlador convierte explícitamente entre Reactor y RxJava
  con RxJava3Adapter; el adaptador Mongo hace lo mismo con
  ReactiveMongoRepository y ReactiveMongoTemplate.
end note

note over User, Correlation
  El filtro reutiliza el X-Correlation-ID entrante si no está vacío;
  si falta o está en blanco, genera un UUID. Todas las respuestas incluyen
  X-Correlation-ID: {id} con el mismo valor recibido o generado.
  account-service y credit-service envían el ID propagado por sus WebClient.
end note

== 1. Registrar movimiento (POST /api/v1/movements, interno) ==
User -> Controller : POST /api/v1/movements\nMovementRequest\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
Controller -> Service : create(command): Single<Movement>
Service -> Service : crear Movement\n(currency omitida -> PEN)
Service -> Repo : save(movement): Single<Movement>
Repo -> DB : repository.save(): Mono<MovementEntity>
DB --> Repo : Mono<MovementEntity> guardado
Repo --> Service : monoToSingle(...): Single<Movement>
Service --> Controller : Single<Movement>
Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
Controller --> User : 201 Created + Location\nMovement\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
note right of User
  Invocado por account-service o credit-service.
  El cuerpo del contrato exige productId, productType,
  movementType y amount.
end note
note over Controller, User
  Solicitud inválida: 400 Bad Request.
  Fallo al registrar: 503 Service Unavailable.
end note

== 2. Consultar movimientos (GET /api/v1/movements) ==
User -> Controller : GET /api/v1/movements\n?productId&productType&from&to&limit&cursor
Controller -> Service : findAll(filter, limit, cursor)
Service -> Service : validar limit (1..200), fechas\ny decodificar cursor opaco
Service -> Repo : findPage(filter, cursor, limit + 1): Flowable<Movement>
Repo -> DB : find(query): Flux<MovementEntity>\nORDER BY createdAt DESC, id DESC\nLIMIT limit + 1
DB --> Repo : Flux<MovementEntity>
Repo --> Service : fluxToFlowable(...): Flowable<Movement>
Service -> Service : Flowable.toList(): Single<List<Movement>>;\nconservar hasta limit y crear cursor
Service --> Controller : Single<MovementPage>
Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)\ny Flux.fromIterable(page.movements())
Controller --> User : 200 OK + Movement[]\nJSON o NDJSON\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
opt hay página siguiente
  Controller --> User : cabecera X-Next-Cursor\n+ X-Correlation-ID: {id}
end
note over User, Service
  GET admite productId, productType, from, to, limit y cursor.
  X-Next-Cursor se omite cuando no hay más resultados.
  Parámetros inválidos: 400 application/problem+json.
end note

== 3. Consultar movimiento (GET /api/v1/movements/{movementId}) ==
User -> Controller : GET /api/v1/movements/{movementId}
Controller -> Service : findById(movementId)
Service -> Repo : findById(movementId): Maybe<Movement>
Repo -> DB : repository.findById(): Mono<MovementEntity>
DB --> Repo : Mono<MovementEntity> o vacío
Repo --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe<Movement>
alt no existe
  Service -> Service : Maybe.switchIfEmpty(Single.error(...))
  Service --> Controller : MovementNotFoundException
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)\npropaga el error
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found\napplication/problem+json\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
else existe
  Service --> Controller : Single<Movement>
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 200 OK + Movement\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
end

== 4. Actualizar movimiento (PUT /api/v1/movements/{movementId}, administrativo) ==
User -> Controller : PUT /api/v1/movements/{movementId}\nMovementUpdateRequest
Controller -> Service : update(movementId, command): Single<Movement>
Service -> Repo : findById(movementId): Maybe<Movement>
Repo -> DB : repository.findById(): Mono<MovementEntity>
DB --> Repo : Mono<MovementEntity> o vacío
Repo --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe<Movement>
alt no existe
  Service --> Controller : MovementNotFoundException
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)\npropaga el error
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
else existe
  Service -> Service : actualizar tipo, importe,\nmoneda y descripción;\nconservar producto y createdAt
  Service -> Repo : save(movement actualizado): Single<Movement>
  Repo -> DB : repository.save(): Mono<MovementEntity>
  DB --> Repo : Mono<MovementEntity> actualizado
  Repo --> Service : monoToSingle(...): Single<Movement>
  Service --> Controller : Single<Movement>
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.singleToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 200 OK + Movement\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
end
note over Controller, User
  Solicitud inválida: 400 Bad Request.
end note

== 5. Eliminar movimiento (DELETE /api/v1/movements/{movementId}, administrativo) ==
User -> Controller : DELETE /api/v1/movements/{movementId}
Controller -> Service : delete(movementId): Completable
Service -> Repo : findById(movementId): Maybe<Movement>
Repo -> DB : repository.findById(): Mono<MovementEntity>
DB --> Repo : Mono<MovementEntity> o vacío
Repo --> Service : monoToMaybe(...): Maybe<Movement>
alt no existe
  Service --> Controller : MovementNotFoundException
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.completableToMono(...)\npropaga el error
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
else existe
  Service -> Repo : deleteById(movementId): Completable
  Repo -> DB : repository.deleteById(): Mono<Void>
  DB --> Repo : Mono<Void> completado
  Repo --> Service : monoToCompletable(...): Completable
  Controller -> Controller : RxJava3Adapter.completableToMono(...)
  Controller --> User : 204 No Content\nX-Correlation-ID: {id}
end

@enduml
